<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9027" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">collātor</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">conl-</span></b> ), ōris, m.
		confero. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>He who bears</i>, <i>brings</i>, <i>places together</i>, <i>a
			contributor</i>, etc. (ante- and post - class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">symbolarum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Curc. 4, 1, 13</span></i>
			.—<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">salutis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Fulg. Myth. 1, 1</span></i>
			; also, <i>one who pays a voluntary contribution
				to the state</i>, Cod. Th. 7, 6, 5.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>One who compares</i>, <i>a
			comparer</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">et disputator,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aug.
					Ep. 147</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
